2. The ego-browser skill
========================

Rook implements the protocol of the open-source `ego-browser` agent skill by
CitroLabs, which is MIT licensed:

  MIT License

  Copyright (c) 2026 CitroLabs

The skill itself is not part of this repository. `scripts/build-sdk.sh` takes a
checkout of it, applies the patches in `patches/` (a Linux clipboard
implementation and a build-root fix), builds it, and writes the result to
`vendor/`, which is not committed. Upstream commit: `aecc583`.

3. Independence
===============

Rook is an independent project. It is not affiliated with, sponsored by or
endorsed by CitroLabs, and it contains none of their application code. The
name "ego-browser" appears here only to name the skill and the command Rook is
compatible with.
